00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:21.490
Please explain to me
what the actual purpose

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:22.830
of a uvula is other than being

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
a very fancy, squishy chandelier

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.140
for the back of my facial cavity.

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:28.500
- The little boxing bag
that you're referring to

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:29.530
in the back of your throat,

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:32.580
also known as the palatine uvula,

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:34.050
is really put there

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:35.450
in order to prevent

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:38.500
liquids and foods from
entering our nasal cavities.

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:40.100
And it lubricates the throat.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.460
And, one of the most important things,

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:45.490
in case choke it serves
as your gag reflex.

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:47.860
