Patients now are bringing in printouts

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:20.310
of what they read online
about their condition

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:21.460
or potential condition.

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:24.260
While a lot of the stuff you
find online is not accurate,

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:25.920
it fosters a good conversation

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:27.660
so you understand how
a doctor's mind works,

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:28.493
so I'm all for it.

00:02:28.493 --> 00:02:29.810
As long as you bring it in,

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.285
and not just self-treat.

00:02:31.285 --> 00:02:33.868
