I am literally falling apart.

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:47.750
I had eye surgery,

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.470
my teeth are falling apart,

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:51.987
I had some abnormal vein on my face,

00:02:51.987 --> 00:02:53.610
I had my shoulder injected

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.700
'cause I had AC joint arthropathy,

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:57.500
my low back has been acting up,

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.850
I can't stand up without
